t to her awakening, with her back touching Ivy's. Dove smiles kindly at Ivy. The words \"Hard Feelings\" fade in behind her and fade out.\n\nIntro 2 [] Ivy looks away with a frown. The words \"A Complete MAP\" fade in and fade out at the end.\n\n1 [] Ivy stands up exits the den. Dove watches her, looking concerned. Snow is falling from the sky.\n\n2 [] Ivy begins to walk out of camp. Dove finally leaves the den to catch up with Ivy, just to watch her tail disappear.\n\n3 [] Dove sighs. It fades back to the past, where Young Ivy and Young Dove are playing as kits.\n\n4 [] Transition to Young Ivy and Young Dove hunting in the forest, as apprentices. Dove congratulates Ivy on a catch.\n\n5 [] Transition to Young Dove and Young Ivy are laughing in the forest. Ivy smiles at Dove.\n\n6 [] Transition back to the present, where Dove lip-syncs \"Hard Feelings\". \n\n7 [] Ivy, alone in the forest, lip-syncs \"Hard Feelings\" and looks up to the gray sky.\n\n8 [] Nighttime in the abandoned Twolegplace with Tiger and Dove, deeply in love.\n\n9 [] Dove and Tiger are walking together in through ThunderClan territory, shot of them speaking to Firestar. He nods as they smile at each other.\n\n10 [] Ivy, watching from far off, takes a deep breath and starts to cry, alone in the den while lip-syncing.\n\n11 [] Dove lip-syncs \"oh love\", alone in the snowy forest.\n\n12 [] Ivy wakes up in the DF. She spies Hawkfrost is laughing with a silhouette of another cat from behind a tree.\n\n13 [] Ivy steps out from behind the tree and into the clearing. Hawk notices her, turns to her, and smiles.\n\n14 [] Back at camp, Ivy glances at a fresh scar and licks it, lipsyncing \"I used to care about you\". She walks through camp.\n\n15 [] Dove and Ivy bump into each other accidently. Ivy brushes past on \"keep busy\", looking away with a frown. Tiger comes up behind Dove and the two smile to the other.\n\n16 [] Ivy eyes tear up as she storms outside of camp. She lip-syncs \"Why even try?\"\n\n17 [] Ivy finds a mouse and leaps at it, claws unsheathed, only to miss her catch. She sheathes her claws, leaping away.\n\n18 [] Ivy lands on the snow and lip-syncs \"Hard Feelings\".\n\n19 [] Ivy is in the DF w/ Hawkfrost. He smiles kindly at her as she lashes her tail, lipsyncing.\n\n20 [] Antpelt comes around the corner. Hawk tells them to start fighting and they oblige.\n\n21 [] Ant + Ivy fight.\n\n22 [] Ivy pins Ant down and glances at Hawk. Hawk draws an unsheathed claw over his throat, grinning.\n\n23 [] Ivy looks down at Ant nervously, who changes to Dove. Ivy becomes enraged and unlives her with a slash at her throat.\n\n24 [] Ivy pants over the dead body, which has become Ant again. Hawk comes from behind her and grins evilly.\n\n25 [] It fades to the den, where Ivy jolts awake. Dove and Tiger are peacefully sleeping together nearby. Ivy glares at them, standing up and walking away.\n\n26 [] In camp at midday, Dove waves and Ivy starts forward, thinking it's her. Tiger pushes past and they smile at each other. Ivy's expression shifts to hurt, then anger.\n\n27 [] Ivy stalks away, angry. Hawk appears in front of her and comforts her. Ivy looks up at him.\n\n28 [] Transition to the DF, where Ivy spots Tiger walking by her. She hisses at him.\n\n29 [] Tiger looks at her. Ivy realizes that Hawk is next to him, calming down. They walk away and she slips away too.\n\n30 [] Ivy is in a hunting crouch, looking focused. She leaps for a mouse at the same time as Dove and they crash into each other. Dove smiles at Ivy and Ivy snarls.\n\n31 [] Without warning, Ivy tackles Dove, who leaps back, startled. Ivy lunges at her again, drawing blood.\n\n32 [] They fight.\n\n33 [] Same as 32. At the end, Ivy pins Dove down.\n\n34 [] Under Ivy's claws, Dove struggles. She lip-syncs.\n\n35 [] Ivy hesitates before lipsyncing, explaining to Dove that she was jealous (be creative! use speech bubbles or smth)\n\n36 [] Ivy gets off of Dove. The two smile, nuzzling each other. Transition.\n\n37 [] Shots of Ivy, Dove, and Tiger hanging out.\n\nOutro [] The sun sets as the trio sit silhoutted. The words \"The End\" fade in.\n"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"backdrop1","dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"cd21514d0531fdffb22204e0ec5ed84a","md5ext":"cd21514d0531fdffb22204e0ec5ed84a.svg","rotationCenterX":240,"rotationCenterY":180}],"sounds":[{"name":"-2","assetId":"809eeb56c48a9fc83e79fd1739684b95","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":285957,"md5ext":"809eeb56c48a9fc83e79fd1739684b95.wav"},{"name":"-1","assetId":"8ee272b0b5b386713b9721dd9ac8c1d2","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":280115,"md5ext":"8ee272b0b5b386713b9721dd9ac8c1d2.wav"},{"name":"Intro 1","assetId":"d01040f43bad87a950bfe60bef7ca9b0","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":297663,"md5ext":"d01040f43bad87a950bfe60bef7ca9b0.wav"},{"name":"Intro 2","assetId":"df2ab94f1224cfde03451881cc699276","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":302116,"md5ext":"df2ab94f1224cfde03451881cc699276.wav"},{"name":"1","assetId":"aa269833cc8ec1c9fbf19f256561ac3f","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":328994,"md5ext":"aa269833cc8ec1c9fbf19f256561ac3f.wav"},{"name":"2","assetId":"c2382629101baf4945c88313bda9dde0","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":275250,"md5ext":"c2382629101baf4945c88313bda9dde0.wav"},{"name":"3","assetId":"c0bcbbe5f33505396083347c5b263097","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":284009,"md5ext":"c0bcbbe5f33505396083347c5b263097.wav"},{"name":"4","assetId":"0034f60883bf1a5cdb48e8f6c07fe13a","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":224087,"md5ext":"0034f60883bf1a5cdb48e8f6c07fe13a.wav"},{"name":"5","assetId":"bc794ffd956c037c70ecbb892b5b31bc","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":165594,"md5ext":"bc794ffd956c037c70ecbb892b5b31bc.wav"},{"name":"6","assetId":"dc6fb65f6f7079c68edbd4745d2fc19b","dataFormat":"wav","rate":48000,"sampleCount":245931,"md5ext":"dc6fb65f6f7079c68edbd4745d2fc19b.wav"},{"name":"7","assetId":"97a5372f61f